This project's seat root will be $HOME/.pi-seats-wheelhouse-project, keeping this fleet's account files separate from any other wheelhouse on this machine. Confirm or correct the namespace.","options":[{"label":"wheelhouse-project","description":"Use derived namespace wheelhouse-project"},{"label":"Different namespace","description":"Correction path if there is a collision or you require another namespace"}],"multiSelect":false},{"header":"Question 7 — commander","question":"The commander is your own session in this install root and will be recorded as external. Is it launched directly, or under a wrapper/status-line layer?","options":[{"label":"Direct","description":"No wrapper/status-line idle regex needed"},{"label":"Wrapped","description":"Launched under a wrapper/status-line layer"}],"multiSelect":false},{"header":"Question 7 — worker","question":"How many worker seats? One is the working minimum; a second opens another implementation lane when work is queued.","options":[{"label":"Decline workers","description":"No standing worker seat"},{"label":"1 worker","description":"Create worker-1"},{"label":"2 workers","description":"Create worker-1 and worker-2"},{"label":"3 workers","description":"Create worker-1, worker-2, and worker-3"}],"multiSelect":false},{"header":"Question 7 — reviewer","question":"How many reviewer seats? One, until a single reviewer is the thing everything waits on. Reviewers gate every diff before it merges and never review what they authored.","options":[{"label":"Decline reviewer","description":"No standing reviewer seat"},{"label":"1 reviewer","description":"Create reviewer"},{"label":"2 reviewers","description":"Create reviewer-1 and reviewer-2"}],"multiSelect":false},{"header":"Question 7 — verifier","question":"Do you want a verifier seat? It is the consumer-surface walker: an ephemeral pass for one ISA claim and one named surface, using its own account directory.","options":[{"label":"Decline verifier","description":"No verifier account now"},{"label":"Take verifier","description":"Create verifier"}],"multiSelect":false},{"header":"Question 7 — researcher","question":"Do you want a researcher seat? It earns its place when the fleet needs best-practice research before building, landscape maps, or hard-debug source searches.","options":[{"label":"Decline researcher","description":"No researcher account now"},{"label":"Take researcher","description":"Create researcher"}],"multiSelect":false},{"header":"Question 7 — designer","question":"Do you want a designer seat? It earns its place when you are spending more time decomposing work than deciding direction — otherwise you hold that yourself.","options":[{"label":"Decline designer","description":"Principal holds decomposition for now"},{"label":"Take designer","description":"Create designer"}],"multiSelect":false}]}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":13294,"output":799,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":184,"totalTokens":14093,"cost":{"input":0.06647,"output":0.02397,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.09044}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1789486623558,"responseId":"resp_03f919351dfa04c2016aa9661ff5fc87d2ba3f4827b578b9ca","rawStopReason":"completed"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_ois0ndTDTKvb6UEaWwfgV6Bc|fc_03f919351dfa04c2016aa96624e32087d2b3ac25c62d18e6f6","toolName":"AskUserQuestion","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\"answers\":[{\"header\":\"Question 7 — namespace\",\"answer\":\"wheelhouse-project\"},{\"header\":\"Question 7 — commander\",\"answer\":\"Direct\"},{\"header\":\"Question 7 — worker\",\"answer\":\"1 worker\"},{\"header\":\"Question 7 — reviewer\",\"answer\":\"1 reviewer\"},{\"header\":\"Question 7 — verifier\",\"answer\":\"Take verifier\"},{\"header\":\"Question 7 — researcher\",\"answer\":\"Decline researcher\"},{\"header\":\"Question 7 — designer\",\"answer\":\"Decline designer\"}]}"}],"details":{},"isError":false,"timestamp":1789486639582},{"role